<title>UK: Reuters' 8th UK-Asia/Mideast air cargo rate report.</title>
<headline>Reuters' 8th UK-Asia/Mideast air cargo rate report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK to Asia/Australasia/Middle East GBP air cargo market rates per kg for a 100kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>		June 23	 May 16</p>
<p>		   NORTH ASIA</p>
<p>LON-HKG     1.10	   1.13</p>
<p>LON-NRT     1.87	   1.87</p>
<p>LON-PEK     1.50	   1.45</p>
<p>LON-SEL     1.60	   1.60</p>
<p>LON-SHA     1.55	   1.48</p>
<p>LON-TPE     1.18	   1.20</p>
<p>	   SOUTH-EAST ASIA/AUSTRALASIA</p>
<p>LON-AKL     2.20	   2.55</p>
<p>LON-BKK     1.08	   1.12</p>
<p>LON-JAK     1.09	   1.11</p>
<p>LON-KUL     1.07	   1.07</p>
<p>LON-MNL     1.30	   1.30</p>
<p>LON-SIN     1.05	   1.08</p>
<p>LON-SYD     1.87	   1.90</p>
<p>	     MIDDLE EAST/SOUTH ASIA</p>
<p>LON-BAH     0.83	   0.79</p>
<p>LON-DXB     0.67	   0.68</p>
<p>LON-TLV     1.00	   1.04</p>
<p>LON-BOM     0.74	   0.72</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smallcargo agents based at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in sterling per kg.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
